status GREEN -- cold open 198 guards, 193 green, 3 red, 2 gated, tree_moved=no, 2,176s, all three reds named and none mine. docs_command_path GREEN with moved_living=0 and 957 testimony counted; control 10 of 10. phantom_path, exec_bit, ascii_document, shell_dialect, spoken_ascii and living_docs_lint all GREEN after the change. Every page touched grades B or better.
